00:17:50.700 --> 00:17:53.100
What the hell are you all doing?

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:55.970
Juubei?

00:17:57.160 --> 00:18:00.570
You aren't being manipulated by Sen Hime-sama?

00:18:00.570 --> 00:18:01.860
Of course not.

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:03.360
That means...

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:07.360
Don't get in the way, bitch.

00:18:08.590 --> 00:18:09.990
Muneakira!

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:13.820
Darutanian-san!

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:14.540
Let's retreat!

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:20.380
They're getting away!
Everyone, after them!

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:26.380
Any signs over there?

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:27.560
They're not over here.

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:29.340
Keep searching!

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:33.880
Are you okay, Darutanian-san?

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:36.080
Not at all...

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:38.850
With things like this, I can't go back to Yoshihiko.

00:18:38.850 --> 00:18:40.840
Is Yoshihiko-san is?

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:41.880
Yeah...

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:48.440
She found out what Sen was doing
with the treasure, so she sent me to stop this mess.

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:50.360
But I was too late...

00:18:50.360 --> 00:18:54.760
You were attacked too though,
why you weren't getting manipulated?

00:18:54.760 --> 00:19:02.380
Yoshihiko gave me an amulet
that protects me against that.

00:19:03.440 --> 00:19:05.190
Oh? I never knew something like that existed.

00:19:05.190 --> 00:19:07.360
What should we do now?

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:09.630
We're going to the location where the white dress is.

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:13.790
In order to fight against the black dress,
we will need the white dress' powers.

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:15.710
Did Yoshihiko tell you that too?

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:20.890
Yes. Yoshihiko investigated
many of the Toyotomi treasures.

00:19:21.790 --> 00:19:23.710
It's...

00:19:23.710 --> 00:19:25.400
a very dangerous treasure.

00:19:29.920 --> 00:19:31.110
It's in there?

00:19:31.110 --> 00:19:32.570
Yes, right below.

00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:34.950
They're following us.

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:36.610
We'll have to split up here.

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:38.450
But that means you...

00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:41.420
I have the amulet, I'll be fine.

00:19:41.420 --> 00:19:46.870
Besides, as soon as you activate
the white dress' powers, this will all end.

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:47.710
Understood.

00:19:49.210 --> 00:19:55.180
In order for the powers to work,
you must wear the dress and then kiss.

00:19:56.100 --> 00:19:57.950
Why are you so surprised?

00:19:57.950 --> 00:19:59.470
You do frequently, right?

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:01.730
Well yes... but...

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:03.600
No time to lose, go!

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:08.380
Be careful.

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:09.310
Let's go.

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:10.110
Right.

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:23.920
Is this the room?

00:20:30.060 --> 00:20:32.090
The Black Dress was in here...

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:35.890
There's another one over here, Muneakira.

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:40.140
Is this it?

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:42.430
Muneakira...

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:44.350
What's up?

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:47.520
Do I have to put on this dress?

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:52.360
Well, you are the only one here that can wear it.

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:56.280
Yeah... but... if I put it on...

00:20:56.280 --> 00:21:00.620
I... will have to... kiss you... right?

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:04.330
Darutanian!

00:21:05.350 --> 00:21:06.540
There's no time!

00:21:19.720 --> 00:21:21.470
Enough, just move aside.

00:21:21.470 --> 00:21:23.980
I know where Muneakira is!

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:27.560
You're not going any farther.

00:21:28.500 --> 00:21:30.860
Do it, girls.

00:21:34.590 --> 00:21:36.240
W-What's that?

00:22:00.610 --> 00:22:01.760
You look beautiful.

00:22:03.360 --> 00:22:04.600
Idiot.

00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:08.440
What the hell are you two doing?

00:22:09.290 --> 00:22:10.890
Sen Hime-sama!

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:12.790
Hurry up and do it!

00:22:12.790 --> 00:22:14.110
Alright...

00:22:18.610 --> 00:22:20.620
I won't let you!

00:22:46.120 --> 00:22:47.180
What is...

00:22:47.180 --> 00:22:48.770
this feeling?

00:22:48.770 --> 00:22:50.650
My body. ..

00:23:03.380 --> 00:23:04.870
Muneakira.

00:23:05.950 --> 00:23:07.660
You are...

00:23:20.150 --> 00:23:22.270
Muneakira! Juubei!

00:23:22.270 --> 00:23:23.220
Where am I?

00:23:23.220 --> 00:23:24.470
Sen Hime-sama...

00:23:29.700 --> 00:23:32.440
Where are my clothes?!

00:23:32.440 --> 00:23:34.400
You somehow managed to save us.

00:23:34.400 --> 00:23:37.400
Seriously, such indecency.

00:23:37.400 --> 00:23:40.030
At least it looks good on someone...

00:23:40.030 --> 00:23:41.740
She should just die like that.

00:23:42.670 --> 00:23:44.780
I'm glad you're all okay.

00:23:46.450 --> 00:23:49.200
I'll go take this back and seal it.

00:23:49.200 --> 00:23:53.430
Do what you want.
That wasn't our main objective anyways.

00:23:53.430 --> 00:23:54.330
Onii-chan~

00:23:55.440 --> 00:23:56.710
Juubei, what is it?

00:23:56.710 --> 00:24:02.340
Now that Juubei is wearing this,
I am officially Onii-chan's wife!

00:24:02.340 --> 00:24:05.100
What the hell are you saying?

00:24:05.100 --> 00:24:08.100
This is one of the Toyotomi's belongings...

00:24:08.100 --> 00:24:10.100
which means it's practically the Sanada's belongings...

00:24:10.100 --> 00:24:12.520
I'm the one that should be wearing it!

00:24:12.520 --> 00:24:14.350
Yuki, do not pull it!

00:24:14.350 --> 00:24:18.360
No, no! I fought so that I could put it on!

00:24:18.360 --> 00:24:20.400
You're one to talk.

00:24:20.400 --> 00:24:23.240
This is for the Tokugawa clan, meaning it's mine!

00:24:23.240 --> 00:24:27.120
I can't just sit here with my arms crossed
after hearing about the Legendary Bride's Dress.

00:24:27.120 --> 00:24:28.510
But this is Juubei's!

00:24:28.510 --> 00:24:29.330
Stop it everyone!
But this is Juubei's!

00:24:29.330 --> 00:24:30.660
Stop it everyone!

00:24:30.660 --> 00:24:32.370
So?

00:24:32.370 --> 00:24:35.450
Will you girls be alright without it?

00:24:35.450 --> 00:24:37.340
Well, that's...

00:24:37.340 --> 00:24:41.800
We will be fine, we just want to be lovers anyways.

00:24:41.800 --> 00:24:42.720
Right?

00:24:44.650 --> 00:24:48.970
By the way, were you really being controlled by the black dress?

00:24:50.450 --> 00:24:53.680
Who knows? It's possible.

00:24:53.680 --> 00:24:55.650
I'm the one that found it!

00:24:55.650 --> 00:24:57.100
It's Toyotomi's treasure!

00:24:57.100 --> 00:24:59.230
I'm the most befitting person!

00:24:59.230 --> 00:25:01.980
Stop it! It's Juubei's dress!

00:26:14.270 --> 00:26:17.560
Samurai Wedding

00:26:17.560 --> 00:26:19.560
End
Samurai Wedding
